name: sim.ungroupShape
description: Ungroups a compound shape into several shapes
luaSynopsis: list shapeHandles = sim.ungroupShape(int shapeHandle)
pythonSynopsis: int[] shapeHandles = sim.ungroupShape(int shapeHandle)
inputs:
1. shapeHandle: handles of the shape you wish to ungroup. If you specify for this argument (-2-handleOfShape), then the shape will be divided instead of ungrouped
outputs:
1. shapeHandles: array holding the handles of the resulting shapes
replacedBy:
- name: ungroup, class: shape, file: shape_ungroup.method
